The task graph (TG) can be simplified by removing the unnecessary conditions and creating a direct sequence of tasks. Here's an improved version:

```json
{
    "owner_agent": "GeoTrigo",
    "tasks": {
        "BuyLongSleevedShirt": "Purchase a long-sleeved shirt",
        "BuyWhiteSocks": "Purchase a pair of white socks",
        "BuyKhakiPants": "Purchase a pair of khaki pants"
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "BuyLongSleevedShirt",
            "to": "BuyWhiteSocks"
        },
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "BuyWhiteSocks",
            "to": "BuyKhakiPants"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```

This revised TG ensures that each task is logically dependent on the previous one, reflecting a clear sequence of actions.
